Hi, Alex,

I'm not sure what that (alphapc600) is; it doesn't match any formal
name for an Alpha system that I remember:

AlphaStation 600 is a SPARSE machine, and wouldn't run the F9 X

AlphaStation 600A was also SPARSE, so ditto

PersonalWorkStation (aka PWS aka MIATA) had a 600MHz model

DS10 had a model that ran at 600MHz, though maybe not sold

AlphaPC164-SX (aka SX164) never had a 600MHz model

AlphaPC164-LX (aka LX164) could be jumpered to 600

AlphaPC164 (aka PC164) was a SPARSE machine, and never at 600MHz

So, what is it REALLY?  :-)

--Jay++

