> new image in text mode but couldn't find how to upgrade.

I think this should be possible.

The best way to do it. Remove all unneeded package from your system - 
minimize as good as possible! Afterwards install the 
fedora-release(-notes) from BUILDSYS and do an online upgrade.

Don't forget to fix /etc/aboot.conf - since the kernel packages don't do 
this automagically yet (on alpha) for you.

That's the way I upgraded my ds10... :-)

Best,
  Oliver



